The RAML specification has been removed: the endpoint `GET /api/v2/raml` and the REST client method `getRAML()` no longer exist, use the OpenAPI specification (`/api/v2/openapi.yaml`) instead. Plugins must be adapted and rebuilt: the RAML model classes (`org.raml.model.*`) are replaced by `com.gentics.vertx.openapi.model.*` (vertx-openapi 1.1.0). The REST API documentation is now generated from the OpenAPI specification.
